---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

// Proyectos publicados: cada tarjeta enlaza entera a su sitio.
const mixturaUrl = 'https://cevicheriarestaurantmixtura.vercel.app';
const ecoproductsUrl = 'https://trazabilidad-app-production.up.railway.app';
---

<section
  id="trabajo"
  class="box-border w-full h-fit shrink-0 flex flex-col gap-12 sm:gap-16 3xl:gap-[70px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 3xl:px-[120px] py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 3xl:py-[110px] justify-start items-start bg-[#0B1020]"
>
  <div
    class="box-border w-full h-fit shrink-0 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 lg:gap-0 justify-between items-start lg:items-end"
  >
    <div
      data-reveal
      class="box-border w-full lg:w-[60%] 3xl:w-[720px] lg:shrink-0 h-fit flex flex-col gap-[16px] justify-start items-start"
    >
      <h2
        class="text-[clamp(30px,4.6vw,62px)]/[1.016] 3xl:text-[62px]/[63px] box-border w-full text-[#FFFFFF] font-[Anton,system-ui,sans-serif] font-normal text-left"
      >
        DOS MARCAS. DOS PRESENCIAS DIGITALES CON OBJETIVOS DISTINTOS.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay:120ms"
      class="text-[17px]/[25px] sm:text-[18px]/[26px] box-border w-full lg:w-[30%] 3xl:w-[360px] lg:shrink-0 text-[#B6C0D4] font-['Funnel_Sans',system-ui,sans-serif] font-normal text-left"
    >
      Cada proyecto web parte del negocio, su audiencia y el contenido que necesita comunicar o
      gestionar.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div
    class="box-border w-full h-auto 3xl:h-[430px] shrink-0 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 3xl:gap-[24px] justify-start items-stretch 3xl:items-start"
  >
    <a
      href={mixturaUrl}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      data-reveal="zoom"
      data-spot
      style="--spot:rgb(200 255 46 / 0.16)"
      class="u-card u-card--onDark u-spot u-arrow-host box-border w-full lg:[flex:1_1_0] h-auto 3xl:h-full flex flex-col gap-8 3xl:gap-0 p-7 sm:p-9 3xl:p-[36px] justify-between items-start bg-[#14213D] [outline:1px_solid_#FFFFFF1F] [outline-offset:-0.5px] rounded-[8px]"
    >
      <div
        class="box-border w-full h-fit shrink-0 flex flex-row flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-3 justify-between items-center"
      >
        <img
          src="/mixtura-logo.png"
          alt="Logo oficial de Mixtura"
          width="2234"
          height="1028"
          class="u-logo box-border w-[160px] sm:w-[210px] shrink-0 h-[70px] sm:h-[92px] object-contain rounded-[4px]"
        />
        <p
          class="text-[11px]/[normal] box-border text-[#C8D1E4] font-['Geist_Mono',system-ui,sans-serif] font-normal text-left [white-space:nowrap]"
        >
          CEVICHERÍA · RESTAURANT
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="box-border w-full h-fit shrink-0 flex flex-col gap-[14px] justify-start items-start">
        <div class="box-border w-full h-fit shrink-0 flex flex-row gap-3 justify-between items-center">
          <p
            class="text-[11px]/[normal] box-border text-[#C8FF2E] font-['Geist_Mono',system-ui,sans-serif] font-bold text-left [white-space:nowrap]"
          >
            CLIENTE ACTUAL · VER PROYECTO
          </p>
          <Icon
            name="arrow-up-right"
            fill="#C8FF2E"
            class="u-arrow box-border w-[20px] shrink-0 h-[20px]"
          />
        </div>
        <h3
          class="text-[clamp(28px,3.1vw,42px)]/[1.048] 3xl:text-[42px]/[44px] box-border w-full text-[#FFFFFF] font-[Anton,system-ui,sans-serif] font-normal text-left"
        >
          EL AUTÉNTICO SABOR DE PUCALLPA.
        </h3>
        <p
          class="text-[16px]/[23px] box-border w-full text-[#C5CDDC] font-['Funnel_Sans',system-ui,sans-serif] font-normal text-left"
        >
          Una experiencia web enfocada en presentar su propuesta gastronómica, facilitar el contacto y
          llevar el sabor amazónico a nuevos clientes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a
      href={ecoproductsUrl}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      data-reveal="zoom"
      data-spot
      style="--reveal-delay:140ms;--spot:rgb(255 255 255 / 0.45)"
      class="u-card u-spot u-arrow-host box-border w-full lg:[flex:1_1_0] h-auto 3xl:h-full flex flex-col gap-8 3xl:gap-0 p-7 sm:p-9 3xl:p-[36px] justify-between items-start bg-[#C8FF2E] rounded-[8px]"
    >
      <div
        class="box-border w-full h-fit shrink-0 flex flex-row flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-3 justify-between items-center"
      >
        <img
          src="/ecoproducts-logo.png"
          alt="Logo oficial de Ecoproducts"
          width="998"
          height="278"
          class="u-logo box-border w-[230px] sm:w-[300px] shrink-0 h-[62px] sm:h-[80px] object-contain"
        />
        <p
          class="text-[11px]/[normal] box-border text-[#25300A] font-['Geist_Mono',system-ui,sans-serif] font-normal text-left [white-space:nowrap]"
        >
          SOLUCIONES AMBIENTALES
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="box-border w-full h-fit shrink-0 flex flex-col gap-[14px] justify-start items-start">
        <div class="box-border w-full h-fit shrink-0 flex flex-row gap-3 justify-between items-center">
          <p
            class="text-[11px]/[normal] box-border text-[#003EAD] font-['Geist_Mono',system-ui,sans-serif] font-bold text-left [white-space:nowrap]"
          >
            CLIENTE ACTUAL · VER PROYECTO
          </p>
          <Icon
            name="arrow-up-right"
            fill="#003EAD"
            class="u-arrow box-border w-[20px] shrink-0 h-[20px]"
          />
        </div>
        <h3
          class="text-[clamp(28px,3.1vw,42px)]/[1.048] 3xl:text-[42px]/[44px] box-border w-full text-[#0B1020] font-[Anton,system-ui,sans-serif] font-normal text-left"
        >
          GESTIÓN AMBIENTAL CON SOLUCIONES INTEGRALES.
        </h3>
        <p
          class="text-[16px]/[23px] box-border w-full text-[#25300A] font-['Funnel_Sans',system-ui,sans-serif] font-normal text-left"
        >
          Un sitio corporativo claro para organizar sus servicios ambientales, demostrar experiencia y
          generar nuevas consultas comerciales.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div
    data-reveal
    class="u-icon-host box-border w-full h-fit shrink-0 flex flex-row gap-[10px] justify-center items-center"
  >
    <Icon name="image-plus" fill="#8E9AB0" class="u-icon-pop box-border w-[16px] shrink-0 h-[16px]" />
    <p
      class="text-[11px]/[normal] box-border text-[#8E9AB0] font-['Geist_Mono',system-ui,sans-serif] font-normal text-center 3xl:text-left 3xl:[white-space:nowrap]"
    >
      PROYECTOS WEB EN DESARROLLO CON MARCAS REALES
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
